==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Osamu Mikumo & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

